ity , libFuzzer , or AFL . Interested in switching release channels? Find out how here . If you find a new issue, please let us know by filing a bug . The community help forum is also a great place to reach out for help or learn about common issues. Daniel Yip Google Chrome","threat_meta":null,"title":"Stable Channel Update for Desktop","topics":["google","chrome","browser"],"type":"advisory","updated_at":null,"vendors":["Google Chrome Releases"]},{"abstract_source":null,"affected_versions":[],"affiliations":[],"authors":[],"cves":["CVE-2026-111497"],"date_precision":"exact","fetched_at":"2026-10-31T05:23:56.856708Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-29T15:11:49.870192Z","id":"vendor:palo_alto_advisories:https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-111497","is_backfill":false,"lang":"en","products":[],"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:15:00Z","published_year":null,"raw_text":null,"references":[],"risk":null,"source_info":{"link_kind":"article","native_id":"https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-111497","source":"vendor","source_name":"Palo Alto Security Advisories","source_quality":"primary","source_sub":"palo_alto_advisories","source_url":"https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-111497"},"summary":"","threat_meta":null,"title":"CVE-2026-111497 Portfolio Status: Impact of Brotli Vulnerability (CVE-2026-111497) on Palo Alto Networks Products (Severity: CRITICAL)","topics":["paloalto","network","firewall"],"type":"advisory","updated_at":null,"vendors":["Palo Alto Security Advisories"]},{"abstract_source":null,"affected_versions":[],"affiliations":[],"authors":[],"cves":["CVE-2026-109618","CVE-2026-109619"],"date_precision":"exact","fetched_at":"2026-10-31T05:23:56.856925Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-29T15:11:49.870192Z","id":"vendor:palo_alto_advisories:https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2026-109618","is_backfill":false,"lang":"en","products":[],"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:54:00Z","published_year":null,"raw_text":null,"references":[],"risk":null,"source_inf